511	     2	//!
512	     3	//! The methods the service has used, oldest first:
513	     4	//!
514	     5	//! - `did:key` — the identifier is one multibase-encoded Ed25519 key.
515	     6	//! - `did:peer:0` — the same, under the peer method.
516	     7	//! - `did:peer:2` — several keys, each tagged with its purpose, plus service
517	     8	//!   endpoints, all encoded in the identifier.
518	     9	//! - `did:web` — the document is published at an HTTPS URL derived from the
519	    10	//!   identifier and fetched through a [`DocumentTransport`].
